    "name": {
      "value": "Wave Warding Tattoo"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "som"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Many cultures of Golarion have a tattoo to turn away harm; as such, warding tattoos often resemble whichever dangers are most common to the culture, such as a wild beast or a whirlpool in the high seas of the Shackles.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** An enemy, hazard, or the environment makes an attack against your AC, requires you to attempt a saving throw, or causes you to take damage automatically\n\nUntil the end of the current turn, against the triggering effect, you gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws and gain resistance 2 to damage.\n\nIn addition to the normal triggers, you can activate the tattoo when you enter an environment where you can't breathe. When you activate the tattoo, it casts air bubble on you, in addition to the other effects."
    },
